    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893350/extras/26cf7e66cb4f1b777a88f04aac9a94fc.avif?t=1747405816\" data-has-big width=800 height=520 /></span><strong>JOIN OUR DISCORD<br>    </strong><br>The game is still in early development so the demo is bound to change a lot.   <br>join the discord to have an impact on the game!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a realm where divinity meets humanity in Liftlands, a medieval fantasy city-builder. As a fledgling god, you wield the power to shape lives and landscapes. Guide your devout followers from the dawn of civilization to the heights of a mystical empire. Balance the benevolent acts of creation with the might of divine wrath, all while defending against the encroaching darkness that threatens your worshipers. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Divine Interaction</strong>: <br>Directly manipulate the world with your cursor-hand of god. Lift villagers, shape terrains, and bestow miracles.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893350/extras/4f002fb256ef077e296e457f859eaf3f.poster.avif?t=1747405816\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893350/extras/4f002fb256ef077e296e457f859eaf3f.webm?t=1747405816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Villager Symbiosis</strong>: <br>Your power grows with your people's faith. Cultivate their society, and they will uphold your divine legacy.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893350/extras/43e8971a3d7162907e769533b74f9a24.poster.avif?t=1747405816\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893350/extras/43e8971a3d7162907e769533b74f9a24.webm?t=1747405816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ritualistic Progression</strong>: <br>Perform sacred rituals to unlock potent abilities. Each choice, a testament to your strategic divinity. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893350/extras/7799c4ba9cce31f2ce8213c699f4a774.poster.avif?t=1747405816\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893350/extras/7799c4ba9cce31f2ce8213c699f4a774.webm?t=1747405816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Medieval Fantasy Setting</strong>: <br>Explore enchanting forests, erect towering citadels, and discover ancient magic woven into the fabric of the world.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893350/extras/905226e262f05ea6f9827d00674227e3.poster.avif?t=1747405816\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893350/extras/905226e262f05ea6f9827d00674227e3.webm?t=1747405816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Challenges</strong>: <br>Face the trials of the night with strategic prowess, as darkness brings forth creatures that test the strength of your divine mettle. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893350/extras/bde4af5bb9aa179340951a676d9cf418.poster.avif?t=1747405816\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893350/extras/bde4af5bb9aa179340951a676d9cf418.webm?t=1747405816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace your godhood and carve your path through history in Liftlands \u2014 where your will shapes the destiny of all.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893350/extras/26cf7e66cb4f1b777a88f04aac9a94fc.avif?t=1747405816\" data-has-big width=800 height=520 /></span><strong>JOIN OUR DISCORD<br>    </strong><br>The game is still in early development so the demo is bound to change a lot.   <br>join the discord to have an impact on the game!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a realm where divinity meets humanity in Liftlands, a medieval fantasy city-builder. As a fledgling god, you wield the power to shape lives and landscapes. Guide your devout followers from the dawn of civilization to the heights of a mystical empire. Balance the benevolent acts of creation with the might of divine wrath, all while defending against the encroaching darkness that threatens your worshipers. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Divine Interaction</strong>: <br>Directly manipulate the world with your cursor-hand of god. Lift villagers, shape terrains, and bestow miracles.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893350/extras/4f002fb256ef077e296e457f859eaf3f.poster.avif?t=1747405816\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893350/extras/4f002fb256ef077e296e457f859eaf3f.webm?t=1747405816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Villager Symbiosis</strong>: <br>Your power grows with your people's faith. Cultivate their society, and they will uphold your divine legacy.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893350/extras/43e8971a3d7162907e769533b74f9a24.poster.avif?t=1747405816\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893350/extras/43e8971a3d7162907e769533b74f9a24.webm?t=1747405816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ritualistic Progression</strong>: <br>Perform sacred rituals to unlock potent abilities. Each choice, a testament to your strategic divinity. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893350/extras/7799c4ba9cce31f2ce8213c699f4a774.poster.avif?t=1747405816\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893350/extras/7799c4ba9cce31f2ce8213c699f4a774.webm?t=1747405816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Medieval Fantasy Setting</strong>: <br>Explore enchanting forests, erect towering citadels, and discover ancient magic woven into the fabric of the world.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893350/extras/905226e262f05ea6f9827d00674227e3.poster.avif?t=1747405816\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893350/extras/905226e262f05ea6f9827d00674227e3.webm?t=1747405816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Challenges</strong>: <br>Face the trials of the night with strategic prowess, as darkness brings forth creatures that test the strength of your divine mettle. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893350/extras/bde4af5bb9aa179340951a676d9cf418.poster.avif?t=1747405816\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893350/extras/bde4af5bb9aa179340951a676d9cf418.webm?t=1747405816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace your godhood and carve your path through history in Liftlands \u2014 where your will shapes the destiny of all.</p>",
